# H1 harvest statement gate: elaboration log

Tool: `bash <S>/tools/leanelab.sh <S>/wt-h1harv <S>/oleans-lm0b <file>`, which runs, verbatim:
```
#!/usr/bin/env bash
# Elaborate one module file of worktree $1 against olean tree $2 (no olean output, nothing removed).
WT="$1"; OL="$2"; F="$3"; LP="$OL"
for d in "$WT"/.lake/packages/*/.lake/build/lib/lean; do [ -d "$d" ] && LP="$LP:$d"; done
export LEAN_PATH="$LP"; cd "$WT"; lean "$F"
```
(direct `lean`, no `-o`, no olean written; `wt-h1harv` supplies only the packages and the
working directory, `lean` reads no TCSlib source but the file it is given). Base: the campaign
tip e831b5b0d887dac3bbf1aa2c19af28983b15b982, exported read-only to <OUT>/base/tip by `git archive`. Snapshot: `oleans-lm0b`
(post-MIG-0b; §0). Toolchain: `leanprover/lean4:v4.25.0`. Pending PRs read as text only:
#92 `lean/b6-hosts` 6158e48fe0fb0a82b91e01f4019e0a3ed63f88ed, #93 `lean/arm-minor-fixes` 3fe6a2deacbf2bd88c92a80def0bfb2fbae0237e. <OUT> is the gate's output
directory, <S> the scratchpad, <REPO> the repository. Run: 2026-10-14 16:55 UTC.

Repository paths: <OUT>/H1Harvest.lean -> audits/evidence/h1harv/H1Harvest.lean.txt;
<OUT>/overlay/H1HarvestOverlay.lean -> audits/evidence/h1harv/H1HarvestOverlay.lean.txt;
<OUT>/probes/ReplayProbe.lean -> audits/evidence/h1harv/probes/ReplayProbe.lean.txt;
ConsumerProbe = the overlay + `scripts/consumer_tail.lean`; the rehearsal as
audits/evidence/h1harv/PostHarvest-CodeSimulator.diff; <OUT>/scripts/* ->
audits/evidence/h1harv/scripts/*; <OUT>/logs/h1-harvest-statements-<x>.log ->
audits/logs/h1-harvest-statements-<x>.log.

